The V2W protocol behaviour implemented here was learned from:

* VirtuosoControl (MIT), https://github.com/AlejandroSocas/VirtuosoControl
  by Alejandro Socas and contributors: wire format, handshake deviations,
  battery filtering, mic-button and software-mode behaviour.
* HeadsetControl (GPL-3.0), corsair_void_v2w: the original handshake
  sequence. Only protocol facts were used; no code was copied.
